  <Properties>
    <newsTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[Guide to Understanding Children Development Stages]]></Value>
    </newsTitle>
    <newsExcerpt>
      <Value><![CDATA[How Cow Paradise blends games, stories and characters into one world where every interaction moves a child forward.]]></Value>
    </newsExcerpt>
    <newsBody>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>Cow Paradise is designed as a connected world where games, stories, and characters work together to help children learn naturally. Instead of separating entertainment and education, the platform blends both into a single experience where every interaction contributes to growth.</p>]]></Value>
    </newsBody>
